pdated_at":"2020-07-04T16:13:02Z","closed_at":"2020-06-03T11:58:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# 🐞 bug report\r\n\r\n### Affected Package\r\n\r\nThe issue is caused by packages @angular/common and/or @angular/router when the router is configured to scroll to anchors with `anchorScrolling: 'enabled'`.\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nWhen attempting to scroll to an anchor using the URL's fragment, the `BrowserViewportScroller` throws `SyntaxError: The string did not match the expected pattern.`\r\n\r\nThe error seems to come from this line : https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/7.2.6/packages/common/src/viewport_scroller.ts#L109\r\n\r\n`querySelector('#<id>')` requires `<id>` to be a valid CSS identifier -- i.e. one that doesn't start with a number or a special character like `_`. The HTML5 spec, however, is not as strict in regard to element identifiers, so there's no harm in wanting to navigate to `#123` in order to scroll to an element with `id=\"123\"`.\r\n\r\nThe fix should be as simple as replacing `querySelector()` with `getElementById()`.\r\n\r\n## 🔬 Minimal Reproduction\r\n\r\nhttps://stackblitz.com/edit/angular-issue-repro2-rmyyfq\r\n\r\n## 🔥 Exception or Error\r\nIn my project, I see the following:\r\n\r\n<pre><code>\r\nSyntaxError The string did not match the expected pattern. \r\n    [native code] querySelector\r\n    node_modules/@angular/common/fesm5/common.js.pre-build-optimizer.js:5736:61 scrollToAnchor\r\n    node_modules/@angular/router/fesm5/router.js.pre-build-optimizer.js:5304:58 \r\n    ...\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\nOn StackBlitz, I get `ERROR DOMException: \"'#123' is not a valid selector\"`. The stacktrace isn't as clear, so not sure it comes from the same place. It's definitely the same cause, though.\r\n\r\n## 🌍  Your Environment\r\n\r\n**Angular Version: 7.2.0**\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"petebacondarwin","id":15655,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15655?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin","html_url":"https://github.com/petebacondarwin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petebacondarwin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/28960/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/28960/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}